            "notes": "## In round 3, you should now have the cash and powers to make this build work!\n\n- [Destruction\u2019s Divide](item_cb7be5fa-0098-4a3c-bf62-efb3738a97e6) gives you the ability to begin focusing down enemy healers with ease. I find myself able to kill the enemy supports or even force out a counter-ult which we are happy to trade as coalescence builds quickly.\n\n- Which leads me to talk about [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) which enables the build to really take shape. This is an absolutely integral part of the build, and should NEVER be swapped out of.\n\n- [Levitation Shawl](item_7b951af4-eb03-4a51-96a0-409f373fb930) is not really necessary but it is seriously one of the most fun items to use across the mode in my opinion.\n\n- [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is one that I swap and change, depending on the line-up. Usually the enemies have pretty strong healing, so I will take it here - but if your enemies aren't running something like an AP Lucio, Mercy or Moira, you could probably pick up an alternative AP item of your choice.",
