            "notes": "## Round 5 is a flex round!\n\n- Personally, I really like [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) and get a lot of value out of it, but it does require some good game/Moira knowledge to know which orb to cast and where. \n\n- An alternative choice could be [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560), as this is an AP/utility hybrid build. Or even [Scientific Deathod](item_d61c724d-0a3e-4a28-bfb5-a7859b799981) for extra ultimate charge if you're good at using Fade.\n\n- Items wise, I usually pick up [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) here, as I am just trying to accumulate stupid amounts of AP - but other utility options are up to you to decide.",
